SUMMARY:Networking & Drinks Night — Bush Week Tech Fest
DESCRIPTION:Cap off the festival with an evening of networking and drinks in the city with speakers\, sponsors and fellow students. We've booked out Bar Lola and Dear Prudence at Verity Lane Market for up to 100 guests\, and every $7.50 dirt-cheap ticket gets you two drink tokens and food. 18+ — bring photo ID. https://anucssa.github.io/techfest-website/events/networking-drinks/
